# TEMPLATE ONLY - this file IS committed, so never put a real key here.
#
# Local dev: create a file named .env in this folder and put your key there.
# Vite's config loads it and passes it to the api/contact.ts handler.
# .env is gitignored, so it never leaves your machine.
#
# Deployed: set the same variable in the Vercel dashboard under
# Project - Settings - Environment Variables, then redeploy.
#
# Get a key from https://resend.com/api-keys (Sending access is enough).
RESEND_API_KEY=
